  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Start",
      "title": "There, to there, from there",
      "learn": [
        "da answers Wo? It is location, with no movement. Der Patient ist da. Ich bin da. The room is im Zimmer.",
        "dahin answers Wohin? It is one word and means to that place. Wir gehen dahin. Kommst du auch dahin? The ward is zur Station.",
        "daher answers Woher? It is one word and means from that place. Er kommt daher. The room he left is aus dem Zimmer. daher is not deshalb.",
        "The adverb can stand in position 1. Then the verb is position 2: Da ist der Patient. Dahin gehen wir. Daher kommt er."
      ],
      "minutes": 25,
      "vocab": [
        { "de": "Patient", "article": "der", "plural": "die Patienten", "en": "patient", "emoji": "🧑🏽", "glossaryKey": "patient" },
